sequenceDiagram
	autonumber
	participant Dev as Human
	participant AI as Claude (SmarterASP MCP)
	participant Vault as Credential Manager vault
	participant VS as Visual Studio Web Deploy
	participant Host as SmarterASP site-749862
	Dev->>AI: Start deployment
	AI->>Host: MCP read-only checks (site, pool, WebDeploy, DB metadata, health)
	AI-->>Dev: Target verified, DB connection template (no password)
	Dev->>Vault: Password stored (AI never sees it)
	Dev->>Dev: Build connectionStrings.config + appSettings.secrets.config, test with Web.Config.SQL locally
	Dev->>VS: Publish Web.Config.SQL as Web.Config plus the two secret files
	VS->>Host: Web Deploy
	AI->>Host: MCP website_restart
	AI->>Host: MCP operation_get_status, deployment_get_status, project_health_check
	AI-->>Dev: Healthy or errors; Dev browses home page and admin login
